%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Thresher
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 14
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Wrecking Ball
    AbilityDescription: 'The ball itself - PASSIVE, always destructive, and its destruction is binary. Below smash speed it wears your DOMAIN colour, destroys rival prisms it touches and BOUNCES off your own domain''s; at smash speed it turns RED, destroys every prism it hits (yours included) and every hit sets off an explosion. The ball and the chain also reach ENEMY VESSELS: each contact is a scored Strike that STEALS petals (the PvP-is-petals-only rule). Charge scales how many: ThresherConfigSO.vesselHitPetals, 1 petal per element at rest -> 3 at level 10 (floor 0.5).'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Magnet
    UpgradeDescription: 'The free ball is drawn toward the nearest enemy vessel within magnetRange (150 u) at magnetAcceleration (220 u/s^2) - it moves only your ball, never the other vessel. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Charge) in ThresherExecutor (MagnetActive -> PullBallToEnemy).'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Mass Mode
    AbilityDescription: 'The A button TOGGLES Mass Mode: the ball builds instead of breaking. It STEALS the rival prisms it touches, SHIELDS your own, lays a trail of your prisms behind it and never explodes - and the energy the chain''s kills bank keeps building instead of being spent, so leaving Mass Mode makes the next rival hit a bigger blast. Mass scales the SIZE of the trail prisms the ball lays: ThresherConfigSO.massTrailScale on every axis of massTrailPrismScale, x1 at rest -> x2 at level 10 (floor x0.5).'
    Input: 6
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Armoured Trail
    UpgradeDescription: 'The prisms the ball lays in Mass Mode are laid SHIELDED (per-lay snapshot). Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Mass) in ThresherExecutor.LayTrailPrism (ArmouredTrailActive).'
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Winch
    AbilityDescription: 'The RIGHT trigger. Hold to let chain out (longer reach, slower whip); release and it reels in fast, conserving the ball''s spin - the crack. The chain, taut or slack, SLICES rival prisms it touches and SHIELDS your own; each kill banks energy for the ball''s next explosion (the Space card shows how much radius is banked). Space scales the LARGEST explosion the bank can buy: ThresherConfigSO.energyMaxDiameterScale, x4 diameter at rest -> x8 at level 10 (floor x2).'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Breaker
    UpgradeDescription: 'A RED (smash-speed) ball''s direct hit destroys super-shielded prisms, through the sanctioned DeactivateShields -> Damage(devastate) sequence. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Space) in ThresherExecutor.SweepBall (BreakerActive). (Until 2026-10-13 Space 5 was Reaper Chain.)'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Plant
    AbilityDescription: 'The LEFT trigger. Hold to skid the ball to a stop and swing round it, faster every lap (right trigger up winds you in and spins you faster). A fast spin hands the camera to the launch view: the sticks pick a launch point on the circle and releasing LT launches from it, along the dotted line, as the ship comes round. Time scales how fast the spin winds up to launch speed: ThresherConfigSO.spinMultiplier on the spin-up rate AND its cap, x1 at rest -> x1.75 at level 10 (floor x0.5).'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Perfect Release
    UpgradeDescription: 'A release timed inside the window - the ship reaches the launch point within perfectWindowSeconds (0.25 s) of LT coming up, while the dotted line is lime - launches perfectBoost (x1.6) faster than the orbit. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Time) in ThresherExecutor.EndPlant (PerfectReleaseActive -> ThresherChainSolver.ArmLaunch).'
